# LightRAG graph store — DECISION (docs/DESIGN.md section 7): the desktop indexes and
# COMMITS the store so the GPU-less laptop can query without re-indexing. So we TRACK it.
# To switch to per-machine indexing instead, uncomment:
# store/

# Never commit model blobs
*.gguf

